     </item>
     <item row="3" column="0" colspan="2">
      <widget class="QLabel" name="label_4">
       <property name="toolTip">
        <string>&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
&lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:'DejaVu Sans'; font-size:10pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Choose a suffix for each recording setup used in parallel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;This will be used to separate source (raw) files from target (converted) files.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;For &lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;CED Spike2&lt;/span&gt; systems, a setup can only record up to 32 channels, but several setups can be used in parallel. Provide one suffix per setup. &lt;span style=&quot; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Examples&lt;/span&gt;: ced1, ced2, wideband, filtered, etc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;Neuralynx&lt;/span&gt; systems do not include more than one setup. Provide a single suffix. &lt;span style=&quot; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Example&lt;/span&gt;: nlx.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
       </property>
       <property name="text">
        <string>Recording Setups</string>
       </property>
      </widget>
     </item>
     <item row="3" column="2">
      <widget class="QTableWidget" name="suffixes">
       <property name="toolTip">
        <string>&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
&lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:'DejaVu Sans'; font-size:9pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt;&quot;&gt;Choose a suffix for each recording setup used in parallel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-size:10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt;&quot;&gt;This will be used to separate source (raw) files from target (converted) files.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-size:10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;Amplipex &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt;&quot;&gt;and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;Neuralynx&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt;&quot;&gt; systems consist of single setups. Provide one suffix. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Examples&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt;&quot;&gt;: apx, nlx.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-size:10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt;&quot;&gt;For &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;CED Spike2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt;&quot;&gt; systems, several setups can be used in parallel to overcome the limited number of channels per setup. Provide one suffix per setup. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Examples&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10pt;&quot;&gt;: ced1, ced2, wideband, filtered, etc.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-size:10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-size:10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
       </property>
       <column>
        <property name="text">
         <string>Suffixes</string>
        </property>
       </column>
      </widget>
     </item>
     <item row="1" column="0" colspan="2">
